<!-- ===== PROJECT 10: CHM LOGISTICS ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Chemical Logistics Operations Dashboard {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`FastAPI` `PostgreSQL` `Power BI` `Python` `Data Integrity`
:::

Built a live FastAPI operations dashboard covering dispatch, drivers, and
executive views for the chemical logistics business, alongside a parallel
Power BI DAX rebuild. Root-caused a join fan-out bug that had inflated a
cost KPI to $17.3B and led a full three-tab filter audit that corrected
mismatched region and employee scoping across every chart.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** $17.3B → $29M cost-KPI fix · 3-tab filter audit shipped same-day · 1,600+ fuel transactions geocoded for a live map
:::

[View Details →](projects/chm-logistics.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 11: EHS REPORT ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### EHS Compliance Dashboard & RLS Security Pattern {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`FastAPI` `PostgreSQL` `dbt` `Row-Level Security` `Jira API`
:::

Replaced a static, offline safety-compliance report with a live dbt-backed
dashboard, then piloted the platform's first row-level-security admin
pattern — scoping what each viewer can see by business unit, region, or
site. Now the reference implementation being ported to every other
dashboard, alongside a shared request-access/feedback pipeline used
company-wide.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Promoted to production · First RLS admin pattern on the platform · Shared access-request/feedback pages adopted org-wide
:::

[View Details →](projects/ehs-report.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 12: HR REPORT ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Workforce Turnover Analytics {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`FastAPI` `Pandas` `PostgreSQL` `Power BI`
:::

Rebuilt a turnover-analytics report that had been failing on every request
into a production tool tracking voluntary and involuntary attrition across
seven termination categories. Root-caused and corrected a statistical
artifact that was inflating attrition rates toward 900%+ for a business
unit that was being wound down.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Promoted to production · 7 termination categories tracked · Root-caused a rate-explosion artifact for restructuring orgs
:::

[View Details →](projects/hr-report.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 13: NE DISPOSAL DAILY ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Disposal Facility Volumes — Incident Response {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`FastAPI` `dbt` `PostgreSQL` `Root-Cause Analysis`
:::

When a live disposal-volumes dashboard silently stopped updating, traced
the failure three layers deep to an upstream dbt model that had been
archived by another engineer unaware this app still depended on it
directly — and restored the pipeline with zero downstream impact to any
other report.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Diagnosed a silent multi-day data freeze · Zero-impact fix to a shared pipeline · Failure mode documented platform-wide
:::

[View Details →](projects/ne-disposal-daily.qmd){.project-link}

:::


