::: {.project-card}

### Financial & Volumes Reporting Platform {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`FastAPI` `PostgreSQL` `Jinja2` `Power BI`
:::

Own and maintain the company's primary P&L and Volumes reporting
platform — also the shared landing page for every internal analytics app.
Delivered a filter-and-export audit across six report pages, fixed frozen
column rendering and section-total logic, and capped a data anomaly that
was displaying gross-margin percentages in the billions of percent.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Shared landing page for 8+ analytics apps · 6-page filter audit shipped · Astronomical GM% bug capped
:::

[View Details →](projects/tre-reports.qmd){.project-link}

:::


