::: {.project-card}

### Platform Reliability & Data Governance Initiative {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`CI/CD` `pytest` `Row-Level Security` `dbt` `GitLab CI`
:::

Led a company-wide "rock solid" initiative across the analytics platform's
apps: audited test coverage app-by-app, stood up a pytest gate in CI so
merges can no longer ship untested regressions, and authored a portable
row-level-security admin pattern now rolling out platform-wide. In
parallel, scoped and prioritized a 139-item audit moving business logic
out of application code and into governed dbt SQL models.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** CI test gate live across multiple apps · Reusable RLS pattern documented for platform-wide reuse · 139-item data-logic migration plan scoped
:::

[View Details →](projects/platform-reliability.qmd){.project-link}

:::


